{"problem_id":"c5c72d45-da71-48b0-a8c8-c43dc7239978","source_problem_id":"508962","normalized_content":{"assets":[{"alt":"","url":"/assets/78192ed1-b58c-4dbe-8364-ff2122bf80c9","kind":"ordinary_image","asset_id":"78192ed1-b58c-4dbe-8364-ff2122bf80c9","asset_key":"image_1"}],"format":"teacherhelper-normalized","sections":[{"key":"condition","html":"<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"78192ed1-b58c-4dbe-8364-ff2122bf80c9\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/78192ed1-b58c-4dbe-8364-ff2122bf80c9\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+a\"></span>. Най­ди­те, при каком зна­че­нии <i>x</i> зна­че­ние функ­ции равно −3,1.</p>","title":"Условие","asset_keys":["image_1"],"section_id":"condition:1"},{"key":"answer","html":"<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-20</span></p>","title":"Ответ","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"answer:1"},{"key":"solution","html":"<p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  −3, зна­чит, <i>a</i>  =  −3. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(−2)  =  −4, тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{k}{-2}-3=-4\\iff k=2\"></span>.  Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{2}{x}-3=-3{,}1\\iff x=-20\"></span>. </p></center>","title":"Решение","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"solution:1"}],"schema_version":3,"problem_reference_ids":{"prototype_problem_id":null,"group_parent_problem_id":null,"adjacent_group_parent_problem_id":null}}}
